            </note>
            <note corresp="#d172-f2" n="3" xml:id="d172-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d172-f3" n="4" xml:id="d172-f3-content">
                <p>The Board of Directors of the Bank approved the credit to Finland on January 16,
                    1946, and the agreement was signed on February 1 establishing this line of
                    credit to finance the acquisition of United States products and services.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d172-f4" n="3" xml:id="d172-f4-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d172-f5" n="5" xml:id="d172-f5-content">
                <p>The Finnish War Criminals Trial.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
